{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"曾国藩·controversies-and-appraisal","stage":"DONE","category":"zeng-guofan","categoryLabel":"曾国藩","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/27_zeng-guofan/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<p>本 hub（争议与评价）是曾国藩（1811—1872）系列的&quot;批判性收束&quot;——专门处理围绕他的争议，并给出全面而辩证的总评。它不重复介绍生平、贡献、思想、著作或影响（那是兄弟 hub 的职责），而是回答一个问题：如何公允地评价这位功过并存、毁誉参半的复杂人物？</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>、<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>、<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>、<a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>、<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>：陈述&quot;他做了什么、想了什么、留下什么&quot;。</li>\n<li>本 hub（争议与评价）：辩证评判&quot;这些作为该如何评价&quot;——焦点是争议、分歧与方法论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置建议：</strong> 先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 了解史实框架（尤其创建湘军、平定太平天国），再读本 hub 的争议辨析会更有依据。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"a-controversial-figure/the-suppression-of-taiping\">镇压太平天国的争议</a> —— 争议的核心史实与立场演变（含屠城、形象五变）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-controversial-figure/loyalty-to-the-qing\">忠君与气节之辩</a> —— 政治忠诚是气节还是愚忠（含 1864 裁军）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"debates/hero-or-butcher\">功臣还是刽子手</a> —— 最尖锐的正反对决与&quot;分账法&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"debates/sincerity-questioned\">真诚还是权术之辩</a> —— 人格层面：修身是真诚还是权术。</li>\n<li><a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-model-of-cultivation\">修身的楷模</a> —— 争议之外最被公认的正面遗产。</li>\n<li><a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a> —— 综合总评，确立&quot;分账法&quot;总纲。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>贯穿全 hub 的方法论是&quot;分账&quot;：区分事实与评价、对象与品质、道德与实用、可学与可争议，拒绝把复杂人物压成单一标签。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-controversial-figure","title":"A Controversial Figure","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/a-controversial-figure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-suppression-of-taiping","title":"镇压太平天国的争议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/a-controversial-figure/the-suppression-of-taiping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"loyalty-to-the-qing","title":"忠君与气节之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/a-controversial-figure/loyalty-to-the-qing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hero-or-butcher","title":"功臣还是刽子手","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/hero-or-butcher"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sincerity-questioned","title":"真诚还是权术之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/sincerity-questioned"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-model-of-cultivation","title":"修身的楷模","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-model-of-cultivation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}